    },
    {
      "date": "1967",
      "kind": "sale",
      "description": "Bought after the fire by Wilt Chamberlain (1936–1999) of the San Francisco Warriors, who repaired it and held it until 3 December 1975. City directories never list him at either of its two flats.",
      "source": "corbett-heights-neighbors"
    },
    {
      "date": "1967-02-16",
      "kind": "fire",
      "description": "An extensive fire left the house uninhabitable; the repair permit was filed on 16 February 1967, and the shingles it gained were not part of the original design.",
